          "note": "TEI’s technical specifications assume a 40% hydraulic power loss.",
          "tagline": "Hydraulic drilling unit for excavators",
          "intro": [
            "MME is a lightweight drilling unit for excavators of 5-10 tonnes, with many of the same features as the much larger HEM. MME uses the same aluminium feed system as the man-portable drills.",
            "That is why many contractors regard MME as their “outdoor drill” while the portable drill is the “indoor drill”. With TEI’s patented drifter technology, MME is an excellent tool for installing micropiles, soil nails, tiebacks, rock drilling and the popular hollow bars."
